# Underlay: per voice and section, list of (onset_index, syllable). Onsets exclude tie continuations and rests.
# '-' suffix = word continues. Notes not listed are melismatic.
# Text-led (principles 10.6): the stressed syllable or key word takes the run, the long note or the
# high point; light words and unstressed syllables take one or two notes where the notes allow.
